name: ['Bladewing the Risen', 'Bogardan Hellkite', 'Draco', 'Dragon Whelp', 'Dragonstorm', 'Ebon Dragon', 'Form of the Dragon', 'Hellkite Overlord', 'Kokusho, the Evening Star', 'Nicol Bolas', 'Niv-Mizzet, the Firemind', 'Rith, the Awakener', 'Shivan Dragon', 'Thunder Dragon', 'Two-Headed Dragon']
